cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyDFLT in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PyDFLT: A Python-based Decision-Focused Learning Toolbox"
abstract: >-
  PyDFLT is a Python toolbox for applying and developing Decision-Focused
  Learning (DFL) methods. It builds on existing DFL packages like CVXPYLayers and PyEPO, provides
  additional DFL methods like SFGE and Lancer, and supports use of typical ML tools
  like Weights & Biases and Optuna.
